    "summary": "Take this as your sign to play! \n\nPlay isn't just for kids. According to AUT Professor Scott Duncan, play helps bring us into the present moment, gives us space to switch off, and lets us do something purely for ourselves. \n\nWhether it's sport, gaming, Lego, gardening or a board game with friends, making time for play can be a simple way to support your mental wellbeing. \n\n#PlayMatters #MentalHealth #Wellbeing",
